## 9. Decision Log (Locked)

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| Simulator | MuJoCo | Fastest Python iteration for RL |
| Sensor | RPLidar A2/A3 | Most common cheap 2D lidar |
| Failure modes (workshop) | Range noise, glass dropout, motion distortion | Cover geometric + material + temporal |
| RL algo | PPO | Stable baseline; sensor is the variable |
| DR strategy | Uniform sampling around fitted params per episode | Simple, effective, no extra learning |
| Real-world eval (workshop) | Optional 1-day acrylic panel test | Workshop accepts sim-heavy; real is bonus |
